# NOTE: the Hydrophobicity column is 0 for every type here, so the pairwise
# hydrophobic term is inert with this force field -- which is the state every
# force field shipped with BioSpring was in. The column is written out
# explicitly rather than omitted, so that "no hydrophobicity" is something
# the file says rather than something the reader infers.
